1218,dbn_predict_bel.m,81.668,60,86.67,75,100.0,86.67,80-90,"function engine = dbn_predict_bel(engine, lag)

if nargin < 2, lag = 1; end

for d=1:lag
  newbel = normalise(engine.transmat' * engine.bel); 
  
